WEBVTT

00:01.210 --> 00:03.010
Good morning!

00:03.010 --> 00:05.050
Good morning, Himeno.

00:18.630 --> 00:21.500
Isn't your butt too heavy?

00:27.310 --> 00:29.370
Miss Himeno, that is very vulgar.

00:29.370 --> 00:30.410
Yes, Ma'am.

00:30.410 --> 00:34.510
Mawata will eat in her room again today.

00:34.510 --> 00:36.520
It's a cause for concern.

00:36.520 --> 00:38.120
Shouldn't we bring a doctor in to see her?

00:38.120 --> 00:39.950
She'll be all right.

00:39.950 --> 00:42.480
She's the type that takes care of things on her own.

00:43.420 --> 00:44.720
Since that day...

00:45.560 --> 00:48.430
Say, what do I seem to be like?

00:48.430 --> 00:52.690
If you are alone, you can't hurt anyone, nor will you get hurt.

00:54.400 --> 00:57.460
Since that day, Mawata hasn't come out from her room.

01:03.010 --> 01:04.810
Miss Mawata?

01:04.810 --> 01:07.070
I brought breakfast.

01:10.720 --> 01:12.340
What are you staring into space for?

01:12.980 --> 01:14.650
Hurry up and eat.

01:14.650 --> 01:16.780
Yes, excuse me.

01:27.500 --> 01:28.900
What was that just now?

01:28.900 --> 01:30.870
Yuck! It was some kind of bug!

01:30.870 --> 01:32.470
Tanaka, are you cleaning this place properly?!

01:32.470 --> 01:33.910
Of course I am.

01:33.910 --> 01:35.370
Could this possibly be...

01:35.370 --> 01:37.510
Did you figure something out?

01:37.510 --> 01:38.870
A ghost!

01:41.180 --> 01:42.310
Shut up!

01:42.810 --> 01:44.750
Well? What was that just now?

01:44.750 --> 01:46.520
I said, it was a ghost!

01:46.520 --> 01:48.780
Oh, no! I'm so scared!

01:50.920 --> 01:51.890
That was...

01:52.810 --> 01:56.080
The boundless future stretches across the skies

01:52.810 --> 01:56.080
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:56.080 --> 02:00.120
And I am reborn anew

01:56.080 --> 02:00.120
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

02:00.120 --> 02:07.140
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

02:00.120 --> 02:07.140
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:11.320 --> 02:11.520
Prétear

02:19.370 --> 02:26.280
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

02:19.370 --> 02:26.280
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

02:26.280 --> 02:31.070
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

02:26.280 --> 02:31.070
kimerareta ashita wa nai

02:33.120 --> 02:40.020
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

02:33.120 --> 02:40.020
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

02:40.020 --> 02:44.930
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

02:40.020 --> 02:44.930
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

02:46.760 --> 02:50.630
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

02:46.760 --> 02:50.630
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

02:50.630 --> 02:53.770
If the cold wind glimmers

02:50.630 --> 02:53.770
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

02:53.770 --> 02:59.540
I can hear your voice drifting gently

02:53.770 --> 02:59.540
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

02:59.710 --> 03:00.010
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

02:59.710 --> 03:04.480
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

03:04.480 --> 03:07.020
Warms it so much that it hurts

03:04.480 --> 03:07.020
kono mune o atsuku suru

03:07.020 --> 03:09.750
It all begins from the point of believing

03:07.020 --> 03:09.750
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

03:09.750 --> 03:13.420
These feelings are proof of being alive

03:09.750 --> 03:13.420
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

03:13.420 --> 03:13.720
The endless future and the expanding skies

03:13.420 --> 03:16.630
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

03:16.630 --> 03:20.660
Allow me to be reborn anew

03:16.630 --> 03:20.660
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

03:20.660 --> 03:26.770
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

03:20.660 --> 03:26.770
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

03:26.770 --> 03:31.370
Holding hands with you

03:26.770 --> 03:33.370
sono te tsunaide

03:33.660 --> 03:37.030
Unreaching Melody

03:38.130 --> 03:39.190
I see.

03:39.860 --> 03:42.270
The Princess of Disaster has to be behind this.

03:42.270 --> 03:44.060
She's definitely taunting me.

03:45.600 --> 03:47.610
For wounding me...

03:47.610 --> 03:49.230
You'll definitely pay for this!

03:50.210 --> 03:52.480
The Princess of Disaster is targeting me.

03:52.480 --> 03:55.050
Understood, I'll gather everyone.

03:55.050 --> 03:57.070
We'll investigate inside the mansion.

03:59.350 --> 04:00.510
I...

04:03.050 --> 04:05.390
I'm going to leave this place.

04:06.730 --> 04:11.160
I don't want to drag my family into this, the family that's important to me.

04:11.160 --> 04:12.230
Himeno...

04:12.230 --> 04:14.530
All right! Let's go kick some poltergeist butt!

04:15.800 --> 04:17.170
Wait a minute!

04:17.170 --> 04:19.770
What's with this costume with not even a shred of sense?

04:19.770 --> 04:21.610
It looks good on you, Mayune.

04:21.610 --> 04:24.070
Everything looks good on you! You're so wonderful!

04:24.880 --> 04:27.280
You too.

04:29.010 --> 04:32.580
This is definitely the holy cosplay suitable for ghost hunting!

04:32.580 --> 04:38.220
After all, for occult cases of love and desire, normal clothes simply won't do!

04:38.220 --> 04:40.930
What is this occult love and desire?

04:40.930 --> 04:43.290
Not to mention, why are you here?!

04:44.160 --> 04:48.290
You shouldn't take Yayoi Takato's information network lightly.

04:48.600 --> 04:51.370
I know everything about the Awayuki family!

04:51.370 --> 04:53.470
In other words, you're eavesdropping?

04:53.470 --> 04:57.080
Eavesdropping! It's written "steal" and "listen!"

04:57.080 --> 04:59.210
Oh, the sounds of those words have a connotation...

04:59.210 --> 05:01.310
...of committing a felony and it's so stimulating!

05:01.310 --> 05:03.520
I can't put up with this! I'm out of here!

05:03.520 --> 05:05.720
Oh, Miss Mayune! I'll accompany you!

05:05.720 --> 05:06.810
Go away, rabbit!

05:09.620 --> 05:11.220
Wait, Miss, please wait!

05:11.220 --> 05:11.960
Dad!

05:11.960 --> 05:14.230
Oh, Himeno, you're late.

05:14.230 --> 05:16.230
Are you serious about ghost hunting?

05:16.230 --> 05:17.490
Of course!

05:18.530 --> 05:19.390
Don't!

05:20.130 --> 05:21.670
Don't do this!

05:21.670 --> 05:25.670
It's not an opponent an ordinary person is a match for, probably.

05:25.670 --> 05:27.010
And it's dangerous.

05:27.010 --> 05:27.990
In any case, please stop!

05:28.410 --> 05:31.270
All right! We're about to go on a ghost search, Tanaka!

05:31.880 --> 05:33.280
Hey, Mayune!

05:33.610 --> 05:36.310
If you say don't do it, then I have to do it!

05:36.310 --> 05:37.650
Why?!

05:37.650 --> 05:40.420
I didn't think you were such a scaredy-cat.

05:40.420 --> 05:42.520
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone!

05:42.520 --> 05:43.860
Yayoi...

05:42.850 --> 05:43.860
Let's go!

05:43.860 --> 05:44.620
Of course!

05:44.620 --> 05:46.930
Leave the safety of the Awayuki family to me!

05:46.930 --> 05:48.030
Dad!

05:48.030 --> 05:48.820
Himeno!

05:49.830 --> 05:50.990
Everyone...

05:51.960 --> 05:54.570
Leave that mysterious role-playing party to us.

05:54.570 --> 05:57.100
We'll send a guard while investigating.

05:57.100 --> 05:58.900
Mannen, Hajime, Shin, we're leaving this to you.

05:58.900 --> 06:02.410
What?! Jobs like these are always left to us!

06:02.410 --> 06:03.610
No way!

06:03.610 --> 06:07.310
That's right, a big job like this can't be handled by you after all.

06:07.310 --> 06:10.420
Even I don't have the confidence to do it. This is troublesome.

06:10.420 --> 06:13.080
Can't be helped. We'll do it.

06:13.080 --> 06:14.780
All right! Hajime, Shin, let's go!

06:15.420 --> 06:16.050
Go!

06:16.050 --> 06:17.020
Wait!

06:18.960 --> 06:20.220
How simple-minded.

06:21.130 --> 06:23.090
Sorry for being late.

06:23.760 --> 06:25.200
Sasame!

06:25.200 --> 06:26.560
Are you all right now?

06:27.100 --> 06:28.500
Thanks to everyone's help.

06:28.500 --> 06:29.760
I'm sorry.

06:30.300 --> 06:32.100
It was my fault.

06:32.100 --> 06:33.760
No, it wasn't.

06:35.310 --> 06:36.270
Let's go.

06:39.510 --> 06:40.910
Hayate!

06:40.910 --> 06:44.620
Well, that wasn't really, that is...

06:44.620 --> 06:46.520
What are you talking about?

06:47.720 --> 06:48.750
Well...

06:48.750 --> 06:50.020
Nothing!

06:50.020 --> 06:52.320
At any rate, let's split into two groups.

06:52.320 --> 06:53.220
Right!

06:53.220 --> 06:54.490
I'm going this way!

06:54.930 --> 06:56.130
Don't go off on your own!

06:56.130 --> 06:57.260
Hey, wait!

06:57.260 --> 06:58.660
Then, we'll go this way.

06:58.660 --> 06:59.760
What about you, Sasame?

06:59.760 --> 07:01.330
I'll...

07:01.330 --> 07:02.630
go with Himeno.

07:04.500 --> 07:05.660
I'll put the tea here.

07:06.910 --> 07:08.530
Now, if you'll excuse me.

07:32.930 --> 07:34.900
Just a little longer...

07:35.570 --> 07:37.190
Stay with me.

07:42.110 --> 07:44.080
Maybe it's not outside?

07:44.080 --> 07:47.570
No, no, ghosts tend to like damp places like this.

07:49.310 --> 07:51.820
Oh, this is beautiful!

07:51.820 --> 07:53.020
All right!

07:53.020 --> 07:54.420
Yes!

08:01.130 --> 08:02.420
<i>Les-sheles!</i>

08:08.500 --> 08:10.070
It really attacked.

08:10.070 --> 08:14.810
You could say that, but Tanaka butted his nose in where it didn't belong,

08:14.810 --> 08:17.000
...so the familiar got angry.

08:17.780 --> 08:19.280
What? No!

08:19.280 --> 08:20.510
What are you doing, Tanaka?!

08:20.510 --> 08:21.680
He wet his shorts.

08:21.680 --> 08:23.310
Are you all right, Mr. Tanaka?

08:23.820 --> 08:26.420
Tanaka, became incontinent in the back yard.

08:26.420 --> 08:27.880
Dock three months' pay.

08:37.730 --> 08:39.730
I wonder if he thought of that as weird earlier?

08:39.730 --> 08:42.390
Oh, no, what am I thinking at a time like this?

08:42.830 --> 08:44.240
There's no presence here either.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.430
Really?

08:46.200 --> 08:47.170
Himeno!

08:47.170 --> 08:48.660
Oh, nothing.

08:50.310 --> 08:52.670
Ow, ow, ow...

08:53.710 --> 08:54.680
Dummy.

08:55.210 --> 08:56.200
Hey...

08:57.050 --> 08:58.520
You okay?

08:57.650 --> 09:05.720
mitsumeteru omae no hitomi ga

08:57.650 --> 09:05.720
Your eyes which I stare into

08:58.520 --> 09:00.220
I'm okay.

09:03.220 --> 09:06.460
It doesn't hurt, right? I see, it doesn't!

09:06.460 --> 09:09.490
Can you get up by yourself? You can, all right!

09:06.720 --> 09:15.270
mayotteru dokka de nanka wo sagashite

09:06.720 --> 09:15.270
Are confused, in search of something, somewhere

09:12.430 --> 09:13.200
What?

09:13.200 --> 09:14.470
Oh, nothing.

09:15.270 --> 09:16.360
Sorry, sorry.

09:16.870 --> 09:24.240
nanoni ore wa hidoi kotoba wo haku

09:16.870 --> 09:24.240
But I speak horrible words

09:24.910 --> 09:32.420
nagusame wa hikyou na kigashite

09:24.910 --> 09:32.420
I feel words of solace are foul plays

09:24.910 --> 09:25.980
Hayate!

09:26.610 --> 09:29.210
If you have time to play, start searching already.

09:29.210 --> 09:30.980
If you hadn't...

09:32.420 --> 09:35.620
naa okashii darou demo

09:32.420 --> 09:35.620
Isn't it strange, but

09:32.820 --> 09:34.020
Sasame...

09:34.920 --> 09:36.620
What's with him?

09:35.620 --> 09:40.360
in your eyes naitekurenaika

09:35.620 --> 09:40.360
In your eyes, will you please cry

09:36.620 --> 09:39.520
He's right. We'd better search.

09:39.520 --> 09:40.360
You're right.

09:40.360 --> 09:44.800
<i>in your eyes </i>zenbu no namida de

09:40.360 --> 09:44.800
In your eyes, with all your tears

09:44.800 --> 09:51.930
aa itsuka sono hoho wo nukeru

09:44.800 --> 09:51.930
Someday, I'll wipe all those tears away

09:48.370 --> 09:50.700
I'll go look over there!

09:50.700 --> 09:51.930
Himeno!

09:53.670 --> 09:54.830
I'm in trouble.

10:05.750 --> 10:08.620
I didn't know this building existed.

10:08.620 --> 10:09.920
Nor did I.

10:09.920 --> 10:12.020
Mr. Tanaka, what is this shed for?

10:12.020 --> 10:15.360
I don't know! Now let's turn back.

10:15.360 --> 10:16.730
Suspicious!

10:17.530 --> 10:20.930
Hey, Miss Takato! Don't yell out all of the sudden like that!

10:20.930 --> 10:22.590
But it's suspicious.

10:51.230 --> 10:53.360
It's just an ordinary storage shed!

10:53.700 --> 10:55.000
Mannen...

10:55.000 --> 10:57.300
Isn't this uncalled for?

10:57.300 --> 10:59.600
But if we don't do this, they won't give up, will they?

10:59.600 --> 11:01.540
Go will get angry with us.

11:02.370 --> 11:04.710
No problem! He's not going to find out.

11:04.710 --> 11:07.140
Unfortunately, I already did.

11:08.910 --> 11:09.510
Go!

11:09.510 --> 11:10.920
We're sorry!

11:10.920 --> 11:14.620
Damn it, I get worried and take a look, and I'm at a loss for words out of disgust!

11:14.620 --> 11:17.020
What's the point of you setting an example by playing around?!

11:17.020 --> 11:19.020
That's why you keep being called a brat!

11:19.020 --> 11:19.820
Say what?!

11:21.060 --> 11:22.060
Stop laughing!

11:22.060 --> 11:24.400
Never mind! Go after them!

11:24.400 --> 11:25.360
Okay!
Damn!

11:26.400 --> 11:27.520
Oh, man...

11:31.170 --> 11:34.410
Now that we've run this far, it'll be all right, Natsue.

11:34.410 --> 11:36.640
What? Natsue?

11:37.310 --> 11:40.470
That's weird. I was with her until just now.

11:41.010 --> 11:44.210
Natsue! Hey!

11:51.020 --> 11:55.260
This is the first time I've felt so emotionally weak.

11:55.260 --> 11:57.630
It's something that happens to everyone.

11:58.130 --> 11:59.490
Mikage...

12:00.130 --> 12:02.900
I'm glad you're around.

12:02.900 --> 12:05.700
Please be close to me from now on.

12:05.700 --> 12:10.540
Of course, I'll always be near you, Miss Mawata.

12:13.410 --> 12:14.900
Always...

12:21.620 --> 12:24.720
Oh, I thought my heart was going to stop.

12:24.720 --> 12:27.890
That's why I said let's not.

12:28.730 --> 12:31.360
These, these are...

12:31.360 --> 12:34.060
My precious hair! Two strands!

12:35.100 --> 12:38.000
Due to the shock earlier, my hair follicles expanded,

12:38.000 --> 12:40.100
...and the perspiration became a lubricating fluid,

12:40.100 --> 12:42.210
...and without realizing the hair roots had become loose,

12:42.210 --> 12:45.210
...I rubbed my hair out with the handkerchief!

12:45.210 --> 12:47.730
What should I do?!

12:49.180 --> 12:51.780
At any rate, I'll put my important things in here.

12:51.780 --> 12:52.810
You're depressing!

12:55.920 --> 12:57.180
Miss Takato?

13:01.130 --> 13:02.030
Hey, wait!

13:02.030 --> 13:03.760
What's with her?

13:12.400 --> 13:13.870
How about over there?

13:13.870 --> 13:17.110
Nothing, I'm going back to the mansion.

13:17.110 --> 13:19.380
Yeah, I'll catch up with you.

13:19.380 --> 13:20.980
If you find it, contact me.

13:20.980 --> 13:24.320
Have you thought about what to do when you find it?

13:24.320 --> 13:26.980
The Princess of Disaster must be defeated.

13:26.980 --> 13:28.750
As a Knight, it's what's expected.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.180
Takako...

13:34.860 --> 13:38.160
I wonder where Sasame went?

13:38.160 --> 13:39.490
Yeah...

13:45.470 --> 13:48.230
I don't like stuff like this.

14:01.820 --> 14:02.920
Kei!

14:02.920 --> 14:04.460
I'll go ask what the situation is.

14:04.460 --> 14:05.820
Hayate...

14:08.660 --> 14:12.320
I wonder what Hayate thinks of me?

14:13.100 --> 14:15.900
Stupid, stupid, that's irrelevant now!

14:15.900 --> 14:18.400
I see, no leads.

14:18.400 --> 14:19.960
Isn't Himeno with you?

14:22.370 --> 14:25.780
Let's search separately. It's better that way.

14:25.780 --> 14:27.270
Himeno!

14:28.010 --> 14:28.940
It's a disaster!

14:30.010 --> 14:31.980
What?! You lost sight of everyone?!

14:33.720 --> 14:35.410
No one understands.

14:36.920 --> 14:41.530
I'm not special. No one understands that.

14:41.530 --> 14:45.260
Mother, Mayune, no, they don't even try to understand.

14:47.770 --> 14:51.360
Father was the only one who understood me.

14:56.710 --> 15:01.040
Father knew everything about how I felt.

15:01.880 --> 15:05.580
He was busy with work so he wasn't home very often.

15:06.750 --> 15:10.080
But when Father came home...

15:11.020 --> 15:17.090
When he was home, I could be a spoiled child and a crybaby.

15:19.330 --> 15:25.460
After he passed away, I became alone, alone in the world.

15:27.810 --> 15:32.610
I never thought anyone could open the door to my heart again.

15:33.310 --> 15:34.500
But...

15:39.050 --> 15:41.480
I see, so you're Miss Silk.

15:43.390 --> 15:45.010
Thank you for the postcards, always.

15:46.520 --> 15:47.720
Sasame...

16:02.010 --> 16:05.440
"The One I Love is a Paraplegic," by Raymond Ijuuin!

16:06.180 --> 16:10.580
Oh, I've been looking for this book! I'll secretly borrow it!

16:10.580 --> 16:12.710
If you want it, I'll give it to you.

16:13.850 --> 16:15.150
Mrs. Awayuki!

16:15.150 --> 16:18.120
Some work came in unexpectedly.

16:18.120 --> 16:21.360
It's a little mean to Kaoru, but I quietly snuck away.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.960
Troublesome, isn't it?

16:22.960 --> 16:24.400
It's my job.

16:24.400 --> 16:25.800
Natsue!

16:25.800 --> 16:28.300
My, he's found me!

16:28.300 --> 16:30.630
Yes, over here, Kaoru!

16:31.170 --> 16:34.330
Ta-daa! This is the identity of the ghost!

16:36.170 --> 16:40.480
While I was looking for Natsue just now, I caught it in the third floor restroom!

16:40.480 --> 16:42.810
I somehow think that's not it.

16:42.810 --> 16:43.400
Paw!

16:46.120 --> 16:48.110
It seems to be rather cute.

16:48.620 --> 16:50.020
All right!

16:50.020 --> 16:51.490
Poke, poke, poke.

16:53.720 --> 16:54.830
My hair!

16:54.830 --> 16:57.430
I take it back! That thing is vicious!

16:57.430 --> 16:59.400
Oh, no! I'm scared, Kaoru!

17:02.000 --> 17:04.000
Damn you!

17:04.000 --> 17:05.800
You're just a small mysterious animal!

17:05.800 --> 17:08.910
How dare you pluck out the hair that's more important than my life?!

17:08.910 --> 17:10.170
Eat this!

17:10.170 --> 17:11.110
It escaped!

17:11.110 --> 17:12.270
It's gone...

17:17.310 --> 17:22.450
My shoe went through the Venetian ultra high-class glass table!

17:19.520 --> 17:21.720
Tanaka, broken table.

17:21.720 --> 17:23.550
Dock 6 months' pay.

17:22.450 --> 17:27.360
Please forgive me! Please give me, Your Forgiveness.

17:23.550 --> 17:25.720
Good, everyone's safe.

17:26.420 --> 17:27.650
Let's go.

17:31.230 --> 17:32.160
Himeno!

17:32.760 --> 17:33.660
Uh...

17:33.660 --> 17:34.500
Don't "uh" me!

17:34.500 --> 17:36.600
What are you doing vanishing and wandering around alone, you idiot?!

17:36.600 --> 17:38.170
Who are you calling an idiot?!

17:38.170 --> 17:40.300
You're an idiot so I called you an idiot, you idiot!

17:40.300 --> 17:41.970
Don't call me an idiot, you idiot!

17:41.970 --> 17:42.370
What?!

17:43.510 --> 17:44.870
What are you doing?

17:45.410 --> 17:48.380
A radio program will not save you.

17:49.810 --> 17:52.250
Strangers are after all, strangers.

17:52.250 --> 17:54.450
Look at yourself.

17:54.450 --> 17:57.820
Accept the sorrow which you're feeling now.

17:57.820 --> 17:59.060
Mikage...

17:59.060 --> 18:01.130
You shouldn't be ashamed of hatred.

18:01.130 --> 18:05.600
Knowing how you feel and being honest with yourself will be what will save you.

18:05.600 --> 18:09.000
If you lock your feelings away in the depths of your heart, you'll only suffer.

18:09.000 --> 18:11.200
Honest with myself...

18:11.200 --> 18:14.710
That's right. The love you lost won't come back.

18:14.710 --> 18:16.330
So, you should hate.

18:19.010 --> 18:21.770
Hate everyone who surrounds you.

18:38.330 --> 18:40.430
Oh, I'm sorry. I was dazed.

18:40.430 --> 18:41.230
Are you all right?

18:41.230 --> 18:42.160
Yes...

18:42.700 --> 18:43.560
I'm fine, thank you.

18:47.710 --> 18:49.230
Excuse me.

18:57.510 --> 18:58.500
Wait!

18:59.820 --> 19:03.050
I know someone who looks like you.

19:03.050 --> 19:06.820
I couldn't do anything for her.

19:06.820 --> 19:09.530
All I could do was to watch.

19:09.530 --> 19:13.900
Back then, I should have been sealed with her.

19:13.900 --> 19:14.760
I...

19:17.200 --> 19:18.830
I loved her!

19:20.400 --> 19:21.890
I'm in a hurry, so...

19:23.010 --> 19:24.380
Please wait!

19:24.380 --> 19:25.540
Wait...

19:26.110 --> 19:27.080
Hey, Sasame.

19:27.510 --> 19:28.770
Takako!

19:35.620 --> 19:37.090
What's wrong, Himeno?

19:37.550 --> 19:39.020
Sasame, she's...

19:39.020 --> 19:40.080
Himeno, stand back!

19:40.660 --> 19:41.520
Mikage!

19:44.960 --> 19:49.090
It certainly took you a while to find me, Leafe Knights.

19:50.570 --> 19:51.600
It can't be...

19:51.600 --> 19:55.770
Unfortunately, it's not a lie, Miss Himeno.

20:04.250 --> 20:06.980
Mikage is the Princess of Disaster?

20:08.050 --> 20:10.280
What did you do with the real Mikage?

20:11.320 --> 20:15.090
She's only another one of my identities.

20:17.530 --> 20:18.830
No way!

20:18.830 --> 20:20.230
That Mikage was...

20:20.230 --> 20:21.200
Himeno!

20:21.870 --> 20:23.500
Then...

20:23.500 --> 20:26.500
Then, why were you so nice to me?!

20:26.500 --> 20:29.170
I was just trying to use your powers.

20:29.170 --> 20:31.300
At least, sooner than the simpleton Knights.

20:32.710 --> 20:39.950
But it doesn't matter now. I'll find a new power, a puppet of darkness which will give me power.

20:39.950 --> 20:41.580
A puppet of darkness?!

20:42.820 --> 20:47.990
Now, you can't stop me, Fenrir, the Princess of Disaster!

20:48.560 --> 20:49.490
Shut up!

20:54.300 --> 20:55.100
Sasame?

20:55.100 --> 20:56.470
What's the meaning of this?

20:56.470 --> 20:59.270
Takako, you can't turn back, can you?

21:00.170 --> 21:01.140
I understand.

21:02.210 --> 21:03.330
Sasame...

21:07.180 --> 21:08.170
I...

21:14.550 --> 21:17.920
I'll abandon my knighthood for you!

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
The stars shine in the night sky

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.270 --> 21:39.140
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.270 --> 21:39.140
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.140 --> 21:42.010
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.140 --> 21:42.010
katte na jinkusu

21:42.010 --> 21:47.990
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:42.010 --> 21:47.990
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:47.990 --> 21:51.960
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:47.990 --> 21:51.960
ashita wa egao de

21:51.960 --> 21:58.060
I'll greet you good morning

21:51.960 --> 21:58.060
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:58.060 --> 22:02.370
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:58.060 --> 22:02.370
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.370 --> 22:03.730
My Sweet Heart

22:02.370 --> 22:03.730
My Sweet Heart

22:03.730 --> 22:10.040
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.730 --> 22:10.040
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:10.040 --> 22:13.810
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:10.040 --> 22:13.810
arienai yurusenai

22:13.810 --> 22:20.820
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.810 --> 22:20.820
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.820 --> 22:29.160
To do it secretly, without you knowing

22:20.820 --> 22:29.160
kizukarenai you ni naisho de

22:41.000 --> 22:43.310
Please feel better, Himeno.

22:43.310 --> 22:44.780
You're right, Shin.

22:44.780 --> 22:47.610
It's not good to be feeling down.

22:47.610 --> 22:50.210
That's right. There's no more need for sorrowful things.

22:47.610 --> 22:50.580
The Furthest Ends of One's Emotions
